<%@ Page CodeBehind="Default.aspx.cs" Language="c#" 
AutoEventWireup="True" Inherits="ASPNET.StarterKit.Portal.CDefault" MasterPageFile="~/Default.master" %>
<%--
   <lang>
     <zh-CN>门户根入口通过母版页承载，但页面自身只负责浏览器类型分流；桌面/移动目标由 code-behind 决定。</zh-CN>
     <en>The portal root endpoint is hosted by the master page, but this page only performs browser-type routing; the desktop or mobile target is chosen by the code-behind.</en>
   </lang>
--%>
<%--
   <lang>
     <zh-CN>此标记层不展示业务数据，也不声明输入控件；它保留旧 Web Forms 首页入口，避免把重定向规则散落到静态链接或客户端脚本。</zh-CN>
     <en>This markup layer does not display business data or declare input controls; it preserves the legacy Web Forms home endpoint so redirect rules are not scattered into static links or client script.</en>
   </lang>
--%>
